{"id":"wb-6-886","name":"辛亥滦州起义纪念园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"辛亥滦州起义纪念园","text":"辛亥滦州起义纪念园，位于中华人民共和国北京市海淀区温泉镇显龙山南麓（北京老年医院内），是为冯玉祥为纪念滦州起义死难将士于1937年4月建造而成的纪念建筑群。该建筑群没有明显围墙，现存建筑由南向北一字排开，依次为纪念坊、纪念碑、衣冠冢、摩崖石刻和纪念塔。2006年，辛亥滦州起义纪念园被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BE%9B%E4%BA%A5%E6%BB%A6%E5%B7%9E%E8%B5%B7%E4%B9%89%E7%BA%AA%E5%BF%B5%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":89970137,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89970137","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3928e495c87b008feb906758.jpg","title":"Memorial_park_to_the_martyrs_in_1911_Luanzhou_Revolution_(20170108153323).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Memorial_park_to_the_martyrs_in_1911_Luanzhou_Revolution_(20170108153323).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/Memorial_park_to_the_martyrs_in_1911_Luanzhou_Revolution_%2820170108153323%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"N509FZ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​位于显龙山的辛亥滦州革命先烈纪念园","width":320,"height":223}}